  "question": {
    "text": "Projectiles <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> are thrown at angles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>°</mo></math> with vertical respectively from top of a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>400</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> high tower. If their times of flight are same, the ratio of their speeds of projection <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></math> is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "TbkLY",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "5GihI",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "4iEDB",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dT6tU",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>For same time of flight, vertical component of velocity of projection must be same. Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
